            text: "As typical US ranges, a walking pad costs about $200 to $600, a budget folding treadmill about $400 to $900, a mid-range home treadmill about $1,000 to $2,000, a premium home machine about $2,000 to $4,000, and a commercial gym treadmill about $4,000 to $10,000 or more. Most regular home users end up spending between $1,000 and $2,000.",
