            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "The Peloton Tread sits in the premium home treadmill tier. Peloton has changed the price several times, so check its site for the current figure and whether delivery is included. Budget for the All-Access membership too, since most of the Tread's classes require it and it adds a meaningful amount over several years.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much do treadmills cost to run each month?",
