            the Amazon links, which does not change which machines we list.
          </p>
          <p>
            The last pick is the entry point to the commercial tier. Heavier commercial machines
            are often bought through dealers with delivery and service contracts, so our guide to <a href="/commercial-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">commercial treadmills</a> covers that tier more widely.
          </p>
        </div>
